WEBVTT

00:06.500 --> 00:10.500
Three drops. By morning, truth go come out.

00:13.000 --> 00:17.500
Mama cook am for you herself! Pepper soup special!

00:20.000 --> 00:23.500
Since when Mama dey cook for me?

00:25.000 --> 00:29.000
Drink am, my daughter. E good for belle.

00:29.500 --> 00:31.200
Oya now.

00:35.500 --> 00:38.500
Wait… wetin be this?

00:43.000 --> 00:46.500
Jesus! Mama, wetin you put inside this soup?!

00:49.500 --> 00:53.500
Na anointing! Anointing dey bitter small!

00:57.000 --> 01:00.000
Ehn ehn! Wahala don land!

01:00.500 --> 01:02.200
Olorun mi!

01:05.000 --> 01:08.500
Ada… I no like this one at all.

01:08.800 --> 01:10.200
Show me.

01:15.500 --> 01:18.800
Mama, you first. Na you cook am.

01:22.500 --> 01:26.500
Na that day I know say… the soup no be for me alone.
